        "id": "T-ALL-1",
        "severity": "minor",
        "keys": "cli.sessions_move_workset.receipt_pending",
        "problem": "'relay' is kept in Latin script. The glossary row 'relay' says translate (relais · relé · 中继 · ретранслятор · chuyển tiếp · ریلے · रिले), and fr follows it.",
        "fix": "use the glossary term for this locale"
      },
      {
        "id": "T-ALL-2",
        "severity": "minor",
        "keys": "cli.sessions_move_workset.reason.too_many_worktrees",
        "problem": "'worktrees' is translated as a calque (arbres de travail / árboles de trabajo / 工作树 / рабочих деревьев / cây làm việc / ورک ٹری / वर्कट्री), but every other key in this namespace keeps Latin 'worktree'. Glossary consistency.",
        "fix": "use worktree(s) as in brings_summary and receipt_*"
      },
      {
        "id": "T-ru-1",
        "severity": "minor",
        "keys": "cli.sessions_move_workset.receipt_transferred",
        "problem": "The neuter 'восстановлено' sits outside the plural block, so counts 1 and 21 render 'здесь восстановлено 1 worktree' (verified in audit.log). receipt_sent puts the participle inside its branches.",
        "fix": "here: one {восстановлен # worktree} few/many/other {восстановлено # worktree}"
      },
      {
        "id": "T-ru-2",
        "severity": "nit",
        "keys": "cli.sessions_move_workset.receipt_sent_unknown",
        "problem": "'На этом устройстве осталась его копия': 'его' can be read as {device}'s copy, because the previous clause's 'его ответ' refers to {device}. Receipt honesty holds: the copy is said to be on this device.",
        "fix": "На этом устройстве по-прежнему есть копия файлов"
      }
    ]
  },
